    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0041_d20ec1d4049c.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 178px;\"/></p><p>Magnetic moment is given by, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>M</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>τ</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>M</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.1</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
